# Intentionally almost empty. The root .gitignore covers everything here --
# bench/.venv/, bench/models/, bench/corpus/wav/, bench/results/, plus the
# recordings, keys and model files by extension. This file used to repeat
# those four paths, which meant two places to keep in step.
#
# What is tracked in corpus/ is the prompts and the transcripts; the audio is
# not, and is recorded locally with `python bench/record.py`.
